site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.dev3.official [60fff00a6]\n- NOT Reproducible in v4.7.dev2.official [778cf54da]\n\n**Bisect result:** Regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965 `Make memnew(RefCounted) return Ref, to improve ownership safety` \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9227) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nPacketPeerDTLS fails to connect to the server, getting stuck in STATUS_HANDSHAKING. Or it could be that DTLSServer.take_connection() returns peer with STATUS_ERROR and the issue is in DTLSServer.\n\nI'm no expert in DTLS, so hoping someone with greater experience will fill some information in.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Run the project\n3. Press \"Connect\" in the \"Client\" section\n4. Try sending a message to the server\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28929948/mrp.zip)\n\n> **NOTE:** This is a modified version of [https://github.com/Faless/gd-udp-dtls-example](https://github.com/Faless/gd-udp-dtls-example). Credit to Faless for creating this demo. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","